    "created_at": "2022-04-28T22:23:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-04-28T22:23:48Z",
    "body": "Note that the shenanigans in @bathos' last comment aren't actually possible; this algo isn't called on arbitrary types, but only when converting to one of the buffer source types. Converting an ES value to one of those shenanigans types would invoke a different algo.\r\n\r\nThat said, I've posted #1132 to remove the \"type name\" concept.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
